      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "All long‑term residents live in a mobile‑home park on Bay Court, a street that was a dirt road until 1987.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bay_Lake%2C_Florida",
      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Bay Lake was incorporated inside the Reedy Creek Improvement District, a special taxing district that holds most of the city’s powers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bay_Lake%2C_Florida",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The area experiences hot, humid summers and generally mild winters, a typical Gulf‑Coast climate that keeps visitors comfortable most of the year.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
